{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nobody knows where it came from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">How long it's been here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">How it got here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But those who have seen it only know</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It cannot escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Subjugation you're sent deep under ground to a decrepit containment chamber. In the center lies a horror unbeknownst to the world, but always a threat to it. You must keep the systems supporting it running to keep it stable. Giving it a consistent feed of oxygen, water, and punishing it from it's anger is vital to keeping it content and complacent with containment, and to avoid it reaching from the depths to the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have one hour until the next caretaker is in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Good Luck.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2748970?t=1744779310","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2748970?t=1744779310","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748970/351066bf747f930feb408ceab63909a2a97b1e3f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744779310","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748970/351066bf747f930feb408ceab63909a2a97b1e3f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744779310","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"SUBJUGATION contains potentially disturbing imagery such as blood and gore."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nobody knows where it came from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">How long it's been here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">How it got here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But those who have seen it only know</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It cannot escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Subjugation you're sent deep under ground to a decrepit containment chamber. In the center lies a horror unbeknownst to the world, but always a threat to it. You must keep the systems supporting it running to keep it stable. Giving it a consistent feed of oxygen, water, and punishing it from it's anger is vital to keeping it content and complacent with containment, and to avoid it reaching from the depths to the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have one hour until the next caretaker is in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Good Luck.</p>","developers":["Basement Dweller Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748970/b067580f007a543bea87d14b3ce5c576e7dea1c7/header.jpg?t=1744779310","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"SUBJUGATION and all assets included are exclusive property of Basement Dweller Games, unauthorized redistribution is strictly prohibited","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257126555,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126555/movie480.mp4?t=1744779308","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126555/movie_max.mp4?t=1744779308"},"name":"Main Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257126555/e01d4bd87e4f15f6bf1a65e2a9f6c1ef6786fa9a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744779308","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126555/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744779308","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126555/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744779308"}}],"name":"Subjugation","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 3600 6-Core Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon Graphics Processor<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB avai