031751ffa4999cfd77569175ad84ddad.600x338.jpg?t=1744779310"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748970/e38aedadba4375cc174fdd75145572d2f5b7cc59/ss_e38aedadba4375cc174fdd75145572d2f5b7cc59.1920x1080.jpg?t=1744779310","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748970/e38aedadba4375cc174fdd75145572d2f5b7cc59/ss_e38aedadba4375cc174fdd75145572d2f5b7cc59.600x338.jpg?t=1744779310"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748970/6a93266c920573f2608a6be42c8bdad3d91659d6/ss_6a93266c920573f2608a6be42c8bdad3d91659d6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1744779310","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748970/6a93266c920573f2608a6be42c8bdad3d91659d6/ss_6a93266c920573f2608a6be42c8bdad3d91659d6.600x338.jpg?t=1744779310"}],"short_description":"Nobody knows where it came from. But it's here. And you can't let it escape. In Subjugation you're put in charge of a containment chamber for one hour, housing a horror unknown to mankind. Maintain it's oxygen, hunger, and anger, to keep it calm and complacent. Escape means the end.","steam_appid":2748970,"support_info":{"email":"thebasementdweller@basementdwellergames.ca","url":"https://www.basementdwellergames.ca/"},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":null}